{"publicId":"34ca42bd-1604-47d3-b925-fb5cdbc30d48","title":"GraphQL基金会发布HTTP规范解决互操作与缓存问题","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-13T01:16:15.589Z","latestAt":"2026-11-13T01:16:15.589Z","digest":"GraphQL基金会发布GraphQL over HTTP规范，明确200 Not OK等状态码使用规则，新增媒体类型以解决代理缓存混淆问题，主流框架已适配\n\n该规范统一了HTTP动词（如QUERY）和状态码的标准化应用，要求客户端与服务器端使用相同媒体类型（application/graphql-www）和端点路径（/graphql），以解决现有实现中因缓存策略不一致导致的互操作难题\n\n目前React Query、Apollo Client等主流框架已完成适配，但规范尚未正式发布（当前状态为预发布草案），具体实施细节仍需等待官方文档更新","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-13T14:29:50.518Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"GraphQL 基金会发布 HTTP 规范，解决互操作与可观测性难题","latestReport":{"id":"mm71surul71wuo6w5qblycb5l"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fTQJiMmqK1iY","title":"发布 GraphQL over HTTP 规范","firstReportAt":"2026-11-13T01:16:15.589Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"mm71surul71wuo6w5qblycb5l","title":"GraphQL 基金会发布 HTTP 规范，解决互操作与可观测性难题","summary":"GraphQL 基金会发布 HTTP 规范，明确200 Not OK等状态码使用规则，新增GraphQL over HTTP媒体类型，解决代理缓存响应混淆问题。规范还规划了支持QUERY HTTP动词和持久化文档标准化，现有主流框架已适配新规。","source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T01:16:15.589Z","selected":true}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"mm71surul71wuo6w5qblycb5l","title":"GraphQL 基金会发布 HTTP 规范，解决互操作与可观测性难题","summary":"GraphQL 基金会发布 HTTP 规范，明确200 Not OK等状态码使用规则，新增GraphQL over HTTP媒体类型，解决代理缓存响应混淆问题。规范还规划了支持QUERY HTTP动词和持久化文档标准化，现有主流框架已适配新规。","source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T01:16:15.589Z","selected":true}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-13T15:00:00.000Z","heat":6.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T18:00:00.000Z","heat":6.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","heat":5.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T21:00:00.000Z","heat":5.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T22:00:00.000Z","heat":5.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T00:00:00.000Z","heat":5.